The '''Golden State Warriors''' are an American professional basketball team based in [[Oakland, California]]. They are a member of the [[Pacific Division (NBA)|Pacific Division]] in the [[Western Conference (NBA)|Western Conference]] of the [[National Basketball Association]] (NBA). The team was established in 1946 as the '''Philadelphia Warriors''' based in [[Philadelphia]], Pennsylvania, a founding member of the [[Basketball Association of America]] (BAA), and it won the inaugural [[1947 BAA Finals]] that is now considered the first [[NBA Championship]].{{efn|name=inaugural}}

